# cyto-swimmer-v0 — directional BEND swimmer (locomotion controller).
# = senescence's proven 3-phase clock (rr->rg->rb relaxation oscillator) + the jelly's lateralised-bend
#   machinery (bb organizer -> gb gradient -> one-flank clock-gated Contract), with division GATED ON A
#   gb MID-BAND so the gradient itself regulates size (body grows until the gradient covers it, then stops).
# Bonds: rr, rg, rb, gb, bb = 5 (the GENOME_MAX_BOND_TYPES cap). Seed: -Dctrlseed=bb:200,r:500.

# grow biomass
Break rr : Biomass < 4000 : Convert rr @15
# clock fuel + 3-phase ring rr -> rg -> rb (the senescence timer, proven to oscillate + drive Contract)
Light : rb < 8000 & rg < 1000 & rr < 8000 : FormBond r b
Break rb : rg < 1000 : FormBond r r @9
Break rr : rb < 1000 : FormBond r g @9
Break rg : rr < 1000 : FormBond r b @9
# organizer determinant: SYNTHESISE bb (so it's canHold = held + sensed, never shared/consumed -> stays
# intracellular and is allocated off-centre on division). Seeded in the founder.
Light : bb > 0 & bb < 4000 : FormBond b b
# morphogen gradient: only the organizer sources gb; every cell sinks it -> high near organizer, low far
Light : bb > 0 : FormBond g b
Break gb : Conc(gb) > 30 : Convert gb
# LATERALISED contraction: clock rg-low phase AND high-gb flank -> one side pulses on the clock -> bend
Break rb : rg < 1000 & Conc(gb) > 20 : Contract @15
# oriented division: bootstraps at the founder's gb (~30) and self-limits as the growing body's sinks
# drain the organizer's gb below the gate -> size regulation from the gradient. across gb -> 2D sheet, off-centre.
Break rb : rg < 1000 & Conc(gb) > 22 : Mitosis bb across gb @15
# cohesion / self-heal
Break rb : rg < 1000 : Repair @10
